      "proposal/code/avqds_adapter.py and routing.py have modification times preceding the saved manifest completion times, providing partial chronological support.",
      "The available run_experiments.py, analyze.py and attempts_log.md are final versions modified after the primary manifests; manifests record configurations and source hashes, while progress records contain elapsed execution times rather than a record of results inspection."
